nknown.\"},{\"k\":\"x\",\"r\":\"T02\"},{\"k\":\"b\",\"r\":\"C3@2027-01-08T23:50-08:00/SFO>BKK\",\"n\":\"Cash baseline\",\"v\":\"The search returned a USD 605 one-stop EVA Air cash itinerary from SFO to BKK. Its price scope is unknown, so treat it as a baseline—not an all-in award comparison or a per-traveler fare.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"The cash searches returned traveler support for one traveler, but that does not establish quote price scope; award traveler support and seat counts are unknown. The positioning legs are on separate, unverified tickets, so neither their protection nor the ability to use them is confirmed. Award taxes are unavailable for all three choices. Search coverage was partial and results may not be real-time; verify availability, current prices, and ticket details with the providers before booking.\"}]}"
